inder of that  entry was rendered illegible another  entry the foundation was able to recover  from the journal was dated to the day  before they encountered the temperature  drop in the canadian interior the  researcher wrote about how the energy  required for the production of radiation  and from it the toilet paper was higher  than he expected it to be from his  calculations but he wasn't worried and  planned to rework the calculations  slightly differently he didn't have time  to walk it back for more extensive  testing and modeling since the first  test of the prototype was tomorrow from  what the entry read he was excited that  the world would never again need toilet  paper the rest of that page was filled  with equations only some of which the  foundation were able to decipher but the  foundation mathematicians discovered  what went wrong when they solved the  equations by themselves the researcher  had made a very simple error early on  when calculating e equals m c squared  which led to his entire work being  thrown off and coming to a conclusion  that the energy output wouldn't nearly  be as high of course the researcher was  tragically and fatally incorrect his  desire to save the world from toilet  paper shortages might have been  prescient given current events but his  lack of care and patience led to the  deaths of him and all of his co-workers  and the creation of scp-2966  the foundation moved in and suppressed  the event with a cover story of a burst  liquid nitrogen tank and amnestics were  disseminated to any local witnesses  since the foundation couldn't safely  move scp-2966  they chose to convert pine range  research to outpost 117 and contain it  where it was but  scp-2966 story isn't quite done yet  remember how i mentioned that foundation  personnel aren't allowed to try reducing  scp-2966's weight since the incident  well a few months after  scp-2966 was contained an experiment was  performed to see if  scp-2966's mass could be reduced if they  pumped it full of energy while rapidly  removing sheets but  scp-2966 immediately went critical and  exploded albeit with a much lower yield  than if it had been fully energized  outpost 117 was completely destroyed and  all the staff were killed though no  civilians were harmed but in the smoking  crater as cp 2966 was recovered unharmed  and significantly lighter though the  foundation has rebuilt outpost 117 and  recontained scp-2966  they've learned that simply letting it  explode by itself is not a solution this  toilet paper just won't quit now go  check out  scp-1984 dead hand and scp-186 to end  all wars for more explosive anomalies  from scp explained
 

